<title>USA: CB Bancshares chairman plans to retire.</title>
<headline>CB Bancshares chairman plans to retire.</headline>
<dateline>HONOLULU 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>CB Bancshares Inc said its chairman and chief executive officer James Morita plans to retire from his executive roles with the bank holding company and its two operating units by the 1997 annual meeting.</p>
<p>The company said Morita will step down as chairman and CEO once a successor is named, but no later than the annual meeting.</p>
